  <documents xsi:type="kernel:StructuredDocument" id="8c6966e2-e9b7-54e9-8f15-ac05fa46358a" name="Developer completion and demo boundary" format="MARKDOWN" content="Catalogue quantities are 1 through 5; acceptance persists order and dispatch intent together.&#10;Cancellation and preparation compete on one expected-version state transition.&#10;Only the buyer can read/return the order; returns are allowed through the inclusive seven-day cutoff.&#10;Dispatch retry uses orderId as the simulator key; no payment or refund is performed.&#10;Generated function shells require real Go application code. Review endpoint reachability, resource permissions, contracts and naming before deployment." description="Reviewed demonstration model; not a deployment/acceptance certificate" />
